        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "hannah.white@stryker.com",
        "text": "<h1><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><br>\n </span></span><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Synchro SELECT<sup>™</sup> Guidewires</span></span><br>\n <br>\n <span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Excellence comes down to the wire</span></span></h1>\n<p>_____________________________________</p>\n<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Synchro SELECT Guidewires are the Synchro Guidewires you trust, fully optimized.</span></span></p>\n<p>Based on years of partnership with our customers, we understand that neurointerventional procedures now require access to distal tortuous anatomy, and that guidewires need to navigate with greater ease and control. That’s why we created Synchro SELECT Guidewires.<br>\n</p>\n",
